  <h2>When to Seek Medical Attention (With or Without Fever)</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Difficulty breathing or shortness of breath</li>
    <li>Persistent chest pain or pressure</li>
    <li>Confusion or new cognitive changes</li>
    <li>Inability to keep fluids down</li>
    <li>Symptoms improve then return worse</li>
    <li>You are in a high-risk group and have suspected influenza</li>
  </ul>

